        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Brook Tate is an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "artist",
            "ref": "v-artist"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "musician",
            "ref": "v-musician"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and writer. He wants to make maths easier for everyone. When he was young, he "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "was scared of",
            "ref": "v-scared"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " maths and thought he wasn’t good at it. But he loved art, music, and acting."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One day, Tate saw that maths "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "is full of",
            "ref": "v-full"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "patterns",
            "zh": "规律"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—just like art and music. He began to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "enjoy",
            "ref": "v-enjoy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " maths."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On a trip to India, he found a fun way to learn. He used 10 colours for the numbers 0–9, and used "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "shapes",
            "zh": "形状"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to show things like "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "adding",
            "zh": "加法"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "multiplying",
            "zh": "乘法"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "local",
            "ref": "v-local"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " children loved learning this way!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, Tate has written two books about his “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "multicolour maths",
            "zh": "多色数学"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”. He wants to help people who think they can’t do maths."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
